# ── MAINTENANCE MODE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1 = visitors see the "site is under maintenance" screen.
# 0 = the site is live.
# Never applies on localhost, so development and phone testing over the LAN keep
# working either way. There is no admin bypass in production — while this is on,
# the site is closed to everyone. See src/components/MaintenanceGate.jsx.
#
# If REACT_APP_MAINTENANCE is also set in the Vercel project's environment
# variables, that value wins over this file. Check there too before deploying.
REACT_APP_MAINTENANCE=0
